== Ebook Sources

The full ebook source set. This is the taken branch when the edition is the ebook, and its heading and
paragraphs are the only source content that should reach the rendered page.

This second paragraph gives the ebook branch enough body text to wrap across more than one line, so the
raster sample lands on real content and a regression that dropped this branch would show as a visible
reflow rather than a number that quietly stops being read.
